(τ_σ, W_{τ_σ}) is strongly positive if there is an irreducible representation 𝒲_σ of G_σ of highest weight μ = (−c_σ; a_1 ≥ ⋯ ≥ a_n) ∈ Z × Z^n relative to R^+_σ such that, with a = a_σ, b = b_σ,
(a_1, …, a_n) = (−κ^c_{b,σ} − a, …, −κ^c_{1,σ} − a; −κ_{a,σ} + b, …, −κ_{1,σ} + b) (89);
equivalently, iff −κ^c_{1,σ} − a ≥ −κ_{a,σ} + b.
